      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on my sociology dissertation about the myth of meritocracy. can u help me out? i need a summary of the most compelling arguments that suggest IQ and standardized testing aren't actually valid measures of \"merit\" when you look at them in a social/structural context.",
